@startuml culture-boundary
title Culture Boundary ; per ADR-ES-026 + CR-ES-026 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Entity" as Ent
class "Culture" as Cult
class "Organization" as Org
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Process" as Proc
class "Decision" as Dec

Ent <|-- Cult : specializes

Cult --> Org : supports
Cult --> Gov : shapes
Cult --> Pol : shapes
Cult --> Cap : shapes
Cult --> Proc : shapes
Cult --> Dec : shapes

note right of Cult
  Per ADR-ES-026 section 6 + Recon-ES-003:
  Culture is NOT Organization
  Culture is NOT Governance
  Culture is NOT Policy
  Culture is NOT Process
  Culture is NOT Capability
  Culture is NOT IT system
  Culture is NOT Agentic Culture
end note

@enduml
